quizDraft.prompt:
**Problem**

Interactive links and buttons already have their base styling, but pointer users still need visible feedback when they hover over something they can activate.

**Task**

Keep every previous capstone rule. Add only the hover-state rule below so navigation links and primary actions respond consistently to pointer hover.

```css
nav a:hover,
.button-link:hover,
button:hover {
  color: #ffffff;
  background: var(--accent-strong);
}
```

